{"content_hash": "db6cab9507d5dd14", "version_id": 544, "article_id": 55, "level_code": "en_b2", "lang": "en", "level": 4, "level_label": "B2 中高级", "title": "Solanke rescues 10-man Spurs with late equaliser at Man Utd", "title_zh": "索兰克补时救主，十人热刺逼平曼联", "has_translation": true, "topic": "sports", "source": "bbc_sport", "source_url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/sport/football/videos/crz9zdl0g04zo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1590701722867-95e186ddbc24?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8M3x8c29sYW5rZSUyMHNjb3JlcyUyMGFkZGVkfGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTE2NzgxMzh8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Weigler Godoy on Unsplash", "author": "Weigler Godoy", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@weigler?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/a-group-of-soccer-players-playing-a-game-of-soccer-JvccQap9IxQ?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(326, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(4, 46%, 48%)", "label": "SPORTS", "seed": "6686c357331f"}}, "published_date": "2026-10-10", "word_count": 184, "reading_minutes": 0.9, "lead": "Dominic Solanke scored in stoppage time to earn 10-man Tottenham a 1-1 draw at Manchester United. The match at Old Trafford was tense and physical, with Spurs finishing the game a man down.", "lead_zh": "多米尼克·索兰克在补时阶段破门，帮助只剩十人的热刺在老特拉福德1-1逼平曼联。这场比赛火药味十足，热刺最后阶段少一人作战。", "preview": "Manchester United and Tottenham Hotspur drew 1-1 in a heated Premier League match at Old Trafford. Dominic Solanke scored in stoppage time t", "preview_zh": "曼联与托特纳姆热刺在老特拉福德进行的一场英超比赛中1-1战平。多米尼克·索兰克在补时阶段进球，为只剩十人的热刺抢回一分。客队在终场前庆祝这粒绝平球，而曼联原本看似胜券在握。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 533, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/55/en_b2.mp3", "duration": 70.175, "size_bytes": 424800, "engine": "edge-tts", "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural", "word_count": 208, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@fc48a26/content/data/versions/544.json", "paragraphs": ["Manchester United and Tottenham Hotspur drew 1-1 in a heated Premier League match at Old Trafford. Dominic Solanke scored in stoppage time to rescue a point for Tottenham, who had been reduced to 10 men. The visitors celebrated a late equaliser after United seemed likely to hold on for the win.", "Tottenham were forced to play a man down for part of the game, which made their task much harder. Despite the disadvantage, they kept pushing forward and refused to give up. Solanke's goal came in added time, catching United off guard and silencing the home crowd.", "United had taken the lead earlier and looked in control for long periods. However, they failed to score a second goal, which allowed Spurs to stay in the match. The result leaves both teams sharing the points, a outcome that will frustrate United and delight Tottenham.", "The match was feisty, with both sides committed to strong challenges. The draw means Tottenham showed resilience, while United will regret not finishing the job. The Premier League season continues, and both clubs will look to improve in their next fixtures."], "paragraphs_zh": ["曼联与托特纳姆热刺在老特拉福德进行的一场英超比赛中1-1战平。多米尼克·索兰克在补时阶段进球，为只剩十人的热刺抢回一分。客队在终场前庆祝这粒绝平球，而曼联原本看似胜券在握。", "热刺在比赛部分时间里不得不以少打多，这让他们的任务更加艰难。尽管处于劣势，他们仍不断向前推进，拒绝放弃。索兰克的进球出现在补时阶段，让曼联措手不及，也让主场球迷陷入沉默。", "曼联此前取得领先，并在很长一段时间里掌控局面。然而，他们未能打入第二球，这让热刺得以留在比赛中。这个结果让两队各取一分，曼联会感到沮丧，而热刺则会感到欣喜。", "比赛火药味十足，双方都拼抢激烈。这场平局意味着热刺展现了韧性，而曼联则会后悔未能拿下比赛。英超赛季仍在继续，两家俱乐部都希望在接下来的比赛中有所改进。"], "body": "Manchester United and Tottenham Hotspur drew 1-1 in a heated Premier League match at Old Trafford. Dominic Solanke scored in stoppage time to rescue a point for Tottenham, who had been reduced to 10 men. The visitors celebrated a late equaliser after United seemed likely to hold on for the win.\n\nTottenham were forced to play a man down for part of the game, which made their task much harder. Despite the disadvantage, they kept pushing forward and refused to give up. Solanke's goal came in added time, catching United off guard and silencing the home crowd.\n\nUnited had taken the lead earlier and looked in control for long periods. However, they failed to score a second goal, which allowed Spurs to stay in the match. The result leaves both teams sharing the points, a outcome that will frustrate United and delight Tottenham.\n\nThe match was feisty, with both sides committed to strong challenges. The draw means Tottenham showed resilience, while United will regret not finishing the job. The Premier League season continues, and both clubs will look to improve in their next fixtures.", "body_zh": "曼联与托特纳姆热刺在老特拉福德进行的一场英超比赛中1-1战平。多米尼克·索兰克在补时阶段进球，为只剩十人的热刺抢回一分。客队在终场前庆祝这粒绝平球，而曼联原本看似胜券在握。\n\n热刺在比赛部分时间里不得不以少打多，这让他们的任务更加艰难。尽管处于劣势，他们仍不断向前推进，拒绝放弃。索兰克的进球出现在补时阶段，让曼联措手不及，也让主场球迷陷入沉默。\n\n曼联此前取得领先，并在很长一段时间里掌控局面。然而，他们未能打入第二球，这让热刺得以留在比赛中。这个结果让两队各取一分，曼联会感到沮丧，而热刺则会感到欣喜。\n\n比赛火药味十足，双方都拼抢激烈。这场平局意味着热刺展现了韧性，而曼联则会后悔未能拿下比赛。英超赛季仍在继续，两家俱乐部都希望在接下来的比赛中有所改进。", "text": "Manchester United and Tottenham Hotspur drew 1-1 in a heated Premier League match at Old Trafford. Dominic Solanke scored in stoppage time to rescue a point for Tottenham, who had been reduced to 10 men. The visitors celebrated a late equaliser after United seemed likely to hold on for the win. Tottenham were forced to play a man down for part of the game, which made their task much harder. Despite the disadvantage, they kept pushing forward and refused to give up. Solanke's goal came in added time, catching United off guard and silencing the home crowd. United had taken the lead earlier and looked in control for long periods. However, they failed to score a second goal, which allowed Spurs to stay in the match. The result leaves both teams sharing the points, a outcome that will frustrate United and delight Tottenham. The match was feisty, with both sides committed to strong challenges. The draw means Tottenham showed resilience, while United will regret not finishing the job. The Premier League season continues, and both clubs will look to improve in their next fixtures.", "vocab": [{"word": "stoppage time", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "补时", "note": "指比赛常规时间结束后增加的分钟", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "equaliser", "pos": "noun", "zh": "扳平比分的进球", "note": "英式拼写，美式为 equalizer", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "rescue", "pos": "verb", "zh": "挽救，抢回", "note": "常与 point 搭配，表示抢回一分", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "reduced to", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "被迫处于（少一人）", "note": "被动语态，表示因红牌等原因人数减少", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "feisty", "pos": "adj", "zh": "激烈的，火药味浓的", "note": "形容比赛对抗激烈", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "off guard", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "措手不及", "note": "catch sb off guard 使某人措手不及", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "resilience", "pos": "noun", "zh": "韧性，恢复力", "note": "指在困难中坚持的能力", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "frustrate", "pos": "verb", "zh": "使沮丧", "note": "常用来描述结果令人失望", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "fixture", "pos": "noun", "zh": "比赛，赛事", "note": "英式英语中常指预定的体育比赛", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "hold on", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "坚持住，守住", "note": "指在比赛中保持领先优势", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "committed", "pos": "adj", "zh": "投入的，全力以赴的", "note": "形容球员拼抢积极", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "regret", "pos": "verb", "zh": "后悔，遗憾", "note": "表示对未能做到的事感到惋惜", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "title_original": "Solanke scores in added time as 10-man Spurs draw with Man Utd", "summary_original": "Dominic Solanke scores in stoppage time to salvage a point for 10-man Tottenham as they snatch a draw against Manchester United in a feisty encounter at Old Trafford.", "body_original": "Solanke scores in added time as 10-man Spurs draw with Man Utd\nThis content is not available in your location.\nThere was an error\nDominic Solanke scores in stoppage time to salvage a point for 10-man Tottenham as they snatch a draw agai